<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Samart Corp Q2 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Samart Corp Q2 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     2.85	 vs	     2.35</p>
<p>    Net		    198.59	 vs	   163.20</p>
<p>					   Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     5.09	 vs	     4.28</p>
<p>    Net		    353.82	 vs	   297.51</p>
<p>Notes: Results are audited. The company's full name is Samart Corporation Plc, a telecommunication firm.</p>
